Spring was finally here.

557
00:27:41,190 --> 00:27:44,310
The birds and the pavenzes were happy to

558
00:27:44,310 --> 00:27:45,350
see spring coming.

559
00:27:46,270 --> 00:27:49,190
They knew they could now fight the witch.

560
00:27:49,190 --> 00:27:51,970
and win, because only winter gave them

561
00:27:51,970 --> 00:27:52,530
can.

562
00:27:53,530 --> 00:27:57,410
When they arrived at the stone table, Aslan

563
00:27:57,410 --> 00:27:58,570
it was already there.

564
00:27:59,430 --> 00:28:02,950
He was beautiful and amazing at the same time.

565
00:28:03,950 --> 00:28:07,570
His clothes were bright as gold, and the

566
00:28:07,570 --> 00:28:10,130
children were amazed with fear and admiration.

567
00:28:11,710 --> 00:28:15,810
Peter accompanied him first, and Aslan accompanied him

568
00:28:15,810 --> 00:28:17,050
and the other children.

569
00:28:17,990 --> 00:28:22,050
Then he asked him, Where is the room?

570
00:28:23,810 --> 00:28:27,050
He left us and joined the witch

571
00:28:27,050 --> 00:28:28,050
white, Peter replied.

572
00:28:29,090 --> 00:28:31,250
I think it happened because of me.

573
00:28:31,250 --> 00:28:33,750
It was not pleasant to Edmund.

574
00:28:34,450 --> 00:28:36,170
Can we still save him?

575
00:28:37,090 --> 00:28:39,590
We can, Aslan replied.

576
00:28:40,650 --> 00:28:42,470
But it won't be easy.

577
00:28:44,210 --> 00:28:47,550
In the distance, Peter could see a palace

578
00:28:47,550 --> 00:28:50,370
on the sea coast, bright as a

579
00:28:50,370 --> 00:28:50,810
star.

580
00:28:52,130 --> 00:28:56,030
It was Caer Paraval, the place where the Pavenzes

581
00:28:56,030 --> 00:28:57,950
were going to be kings and queens.

582
00:28:59,250 --> 00:29:02,730
Suddenly, Peter heard a loud sound.

583
00:29:03,830 --> 00:29:05,610
It was Susan's hat.

584
00:29:06,050 --> 00:29:07,590
I was in danger.

585
00:29:08,530 --> 00:29:11,550
Peter ran to help her and saw a pity

586
00:29:11,550 --> 00:29:12,090
scene.

587
00:29:13,270 --> 00:29:16,470
Susan climbed a tall tree, and a

588
00:29:16,470 --> 00:29:19,050
huge grey animal was trying to lure her.

589
00:29:20,170 --> 00:29:21,190
It was Magrim.

590
00:29:22,130 --> 00:29:24,850
Susan couldn't reach the top of the tree,

591
00:29:24,850 --> 00:29:27,730
and the hat was very close.

592
00:29:29,590 --> 00:29:32,910
Peter felt sick, but he needed to do something.

593
00:29:33,890 --> 00:29:36,170
He tried to reach the cap with his sword,

594
00:29:36,410 --> 00:29:37,450
and lost it for the first time.

595
00:29:38,750 --> 00:29:42,150
Then he went ahead and managed to put the sword

596
00:29:42,150 --> 00:29:43,690
right in the heart of the animal.

597
00:29:45,150 --> 00:29:47,090
For a moment, the hat was calm.

598
00:29:47,970 --> 00:29:49,290
Then he fell down dead.

599
00:29:50,370 --> 00:29:53,170
Susan ran to Peter and they hugged each other.

600
00:29:54,950 --> 00:29:57,370
Then Aslan called Peter and asked him

601
00:29:57,370 --> 00:29:58,690
to rise to his feet.

